def BYX(+xs0: +List<U32>, +y0: +List<U32>, +y1: +List<U32>, +xs3: +List<U32>, +y2: +List<U32>, +y3: +List<U32>, +xs6: +List<U32>, +y4: +List<U32>, +y5: +List<U32>, +xs9: +List<U32>, +y6: +List<U32>, +y7: +List<U32>) -> +List<U32>: List.append(&2, U32, Layout.fixed_parts(PSX(xs0, y0, y1, xs3, y2, y3, xs6, y4, y5, xs9, y6, y7), Layout.fixed_size(PSX(xs0, y0, y1, xs3, y2, y3, xs6, y4, y5, xs9, y6, y7))), Layout.payloads(PSX(xs0, y0, y1, xs3, y2, y3, xs6, y4, y5, xs9, y6, y7)))
def EVF(+h: S.Value, +s: S.Schema, +y: +List<U32>) -> Data: {Codec.parts(h, s) == Some{[S.Variable{y}]} : Maybe<&2, +List<S.Part>>}
def EXF(+h: S.Value, +s: S.Schema, +y: +List<U32>) -> Data: {Codec.parts(h, s) == Some{[S.Fixed{y}]} : Maybe<&2, +List<S.Part>>}
def LXF(+s: Nat, +xs: +List<U32>) -> Data: {Some{s} == Some{List.length(&2, U32, xs)} : Maybe<&2, Nat>}
def mis(a: Maybe<&2, Nat>, +n: Nat) -> Bool:
  match a:
    case None{}: False{}
    case Some{v}: Nat.is_eq(v, n)
def eqM(+a: Maybe<&2, Nat>, +n: Nat, +e: {mis(a, n) == True{} : Bool}) -> {a == Some{n} : Maybe<&2, Nat>}:
  match a:
    case None{}: Empty.absurd({None{} == Some{n} : Maybe<&2, Nat>}, FD.logic__false_true(e))
    case Some{+v}: Equal.cong(Nat, Maybe<&2, Nat>, z => Some{z}, v, n, FD.nat__eq_from_is_eq(v, n, e))
def fzF0() -> {SS.fixed_size(S.BitVector{256n}) == Some{32n} : Maybe<&2, Nat>}: eqM(SS.fixed_size(S.BitVector{256n}), 32n, {==})
def fzF3() -> {SS.fixed_size(S.BitVector{257n}) == Some{33n} : Maybe<&2, Nat>}: eqM(SS.fixed_size(S.BitVector{257n}), 33n, {==})
def fzF6() -> {SS.fixed_size(S.BitVector{1280n}) == Some{160n} : Maybe<&2, Nat>}: eqM(SS.fixed_size(S.BitVector{1280n}), 160n, {==})
def fzF9() -> {SS.fixed_size(S.BitVector{1281n}) == Some{161n} : Maybe<&2, Nat>}: eqM(SS.fixed_size(S.BitVector{1281n}), 161n, {==})
def LCH12() -> S.Schema: S.End{}
def LCH11() -> S.Schema: S.Chain{S.ProgressiveBits{}, LCH12()}
def LCH10() -> S.Schema: S.Chain{S.BitList{1281n}, LCH11()}
def LCH9() -> S.Schema: S.Chain{S.BitVector{1281n}, LCH10()}
